{RUBY_B#I am the bone of my sword.}――体は剣で出来ている。{RUBY_E#}
{RUBY_B#Steel is my body, and fire is my blood.}血潮は鉄で、心は硝子。{RUBY_E#}
{RUBY_B#I have created over a thousand blades.}幾たびの戦場を越えて不敗。{RUBY_E#}
{RUBY_B#Unknown to Death.}ただの一度も敗走はなく、{RUBY_E#}
{RUBY_B#Nor known to Life.}ただの一度も理解されない。{RUBY_E#}
{RUBY_B#Have withstood pain to create many weapons.}彼の者は常に独り、剣の丘で勝利に酔う。{RUBY_E#}
{RUBY_B#Yet, those hands will never hold anything.}故に、生涯に意味はなく。{RUBY_E#}
{RUBY_B#So as I pray}その体は——{RUBY_E#}
